sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / SDK
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Trainer Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as TrainJob Controller<br/>(trainer-controller-manager)
    participant JobSetCtrl as JobSet Controller
    participant Scheduler as Kubernetes Scheduler
    participant TrainingPod as Training Pods<br/>29500/TCP TCP (peer)
    participant PrimaryPod as Primary Training Pod<br/>28080/TCP HTTP (metrics)

    Note over User,PrimaryPod: Flow 1: TrainJob Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: POST TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>TLS 1.2+ (cluster profile)<br/>Auth: API Server TLS client cert
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: TrainJob added
    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET TrainingRuntime / ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Runtime spec

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply: JobSet<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI->>JobSetCtrl: Watch event: JobSet created
    JobSetCtrl->>Scheduler: Schedule training pods
    Scheduler-->>JobSetCtrl: Pods scheduled

    TrainingPod->>TrainingPod: torchrun rendezvous<br/>29500/TCP (no encryption)<br/>NetworkPolicy enforced

    Note over Controller,PrimaryPod: Flow 2: RHAI Progression Tracking

    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET Pod (primary)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Pod IP + status

    loop Every polling interval
        Controller->>PrimaryPod: GET /metrics<br/>28080/TCP HTTP<br/>No encryption, NetworkPolicy enforced
        PrimaryPod-->>Controller: Training metrics<br/>(loss, accuracy, epoch, step, ETA)
    end

    Controller->>K8sAPI: PATCH TrainJob annotations<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token<br/>(progression status)

    Note over Controller,TrainingPod: Flow 3: MPI Training Setup

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE Secret (MPI SSH auth)<br/>ECDSA key pair, immutable
        Controller->>K8sAPI: CREATE ConfigMap (MPI hostfile)
        Note over TrainingPod: MPI Launcher Pod → Worker Pods<br/>22/TCP SSH, ECDSA key auth
    end
